<http://khaos.uma.es/green-senti/earth-observation#identifier> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>,
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                                                               rdfs:comment """Identifier

Example: S2A_MSIL1C_20180603T110041_N0206_R094_T30SUF_20180603T130559"""@en;
