                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                          rdfs:comment """Digital Terrain Model (DTM).
A DTM is a LiDAR-derived raster representing the elevation of the bare ground surface, with vegetation and artificial structures removed. Each pixel stores the ground height expressed in meters (m)."""@en;
                          rdfs:label "DTM"@en;
                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isObservedBy> vas:DTM_UAV_LiDAR_Sensor_1.
